this ticket breaks the shared harness used by nearly every test, not only the rate-specific ones.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"f09c070024260356a","impact":1.0,"is_primary":null,"location":"Acceptance Criteria (symbol/env removal items) vs tests/infra/test_bedrock_spend_cap_handler.py","norm_id":"na97e3f8fa01348a9","priority":0.8,"reason":"high-priority+criterion-opted-in","recalled":false,"scenarios":["Running the named pytest command after the pricing symbols and UNKNOWN_RATE_PER_1K env read are removed: the shared load_handler/run_handler harness and the rate/seed/fallback tests fail to run or error","make verify gate fails on the pre-existing suite even though the new AC-mandated tests pass"],"severity":null,"suggested_fix":"","tier":"LLM","validity":0.8,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"yes","asserted_capability_confirmed":"yes","cited_reference_accurate":"yes","claims_absence":"yes","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"yes","current_state_satisfies_plan_goal":"na","evidence_entails_finding":"yes","impact_follows_necessarily":"yes","is_verifiable":"yes","no_existing_mitigation":"no","no_viable_alternative_explanation":"no","path_reachable":"yes","prerequisite_attribution_valid":"na","respects_artifact_altitude":"yes","severity_claim_justified":"yes"},"severity_attributes":{"ac_unverifiable":"none","blast_radius":"module","debt_impact":"low","divergent_implementation":"omits_required_site","dod_uncertifiable":"certification_cannot_prove","internal_conflict":"none","irreversible_without_rationale":"none","likelihood":"high","prod_impact":"none","reversibility":"easy","silent_vs_self_revealing":"self_revealing","undecomposed":"none","vague_directive":"none"}}},{"block_threshold":0.6,"blocking_enabled":true,"checklist_item":"- [ ] State explicitly that the handler writes today's date-keyed mark (initialised to zero) on the first read of each UTC day regardless of the hold decision, so that the 'present and zero-valued -> may release' disposition is reachable on a fresh idle day and the deny cannot be pinned attached across an idle new day.","cohort":["G6"],"criteria":["G6"],"decision":"advisory","decision_margin":-0.0137,"drop_reason":null,"evidence":["Plan: 'persists the day's highest observed token total, keyed by UTC date so a new day starts absent'","AC: 'An empty read with today's key present and zero-valued may release. Checked: a test on a fresh day.'","AC: 'An empty read with today's key absent and a deny attached holds the deny.'","Mechanism gap: a high-water max has no distinct present-and-zero value, so the transition absent->present-zero on a fresh idle day is unspecified; today's release path (bedrock_spend_cap.tf: the 5-minute rule 'also performs the 00:00 UTC release') depends on being able to release on a new day."],"finding":"The release discriminator's disposition set does not pin how 'today's key present and zero-valued' (which may release) is ever established, given the mark is defined as a high-water/'highest observed token total'. A max-valued mark cannot distinguish present-and-zero from absent unless the handler writes a zero-valued key for today on the first read of the day while the deny is still held; without that step, disposition 3 (key absent + deny attached -> hold) pins the deny attached across an entire genuinely-idle new UTC day and the automatic release never occurs.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"f68332129599b281c","impact":0.67,"is_primary":null,"location":"Approach -> 'Release discriminator'; ACs 'The day's high-water token total is persisted keyed by UTC date' and 'An empty read with today's key present and zero-valued may release'","norm_id":"n83f66aa4aa67d0ea","priority":0.5863,"reason":"default-advisory","recalled":false,"scenarios":["A new UTC day begins with yesterday's deny still attached and no Bedrock traffic all day: first tick sees key absent -> holds; if the mark is only ever written when nonzero, the key never becomes present-and-zero and the deny is never released.","A busy previous day trips the cap; the next day is idle — expected behaviour is automatic release at 00:00 UTC, but the disposition set may hold indefinitely."],"severity":null,"suggested_fix":"Add to the release-discriminator description that every tick persists state[\"high_water_day\"]=today plus state[\"high_water_tokens\"]=max(prior_today, observed) — writing today with value 0 on the first read of the day even when the deny is held — so 'absent' means only 'no tick has run today yet' and disposition 1 becomes reachable once the first (possibly empty) read of the day lands.","tier":"LLM","validity":0.875,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"yes","asserted_capability_confirmed":"na","cited_reference_accurate":"na","claims_absence":"yes","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"na","current_state_satisfies_plan_goal":"na","evidence_entails_finding":"yes","impact_follows_necessarily":"no","is_verifiable":"yes","no_existing_mitigation":"yes","no_viable_alternative_explanation":"yes","path_reachable":"yes","prerequisite_attribution_valid":"na","respects_artifact_altitude":"yes","severity_claim_justified":"yes"},"severity_attributes":{"ac_unverifiable":"none","blast_radius":"local","debt_impact":"low","divergent_implementation":"none","dod_uncertifiable":"none","internal_conflict":"medium","irreversible_without_rationale":"none","likelihood":"medium","prod_impact":"medium","reversibility":"easy","silent_vs_self_revealing":"silent","undecomposed":"none","vague_directive":"medium"}}},{"block_threshold":0.6,"blocking_enabled":true,"checklist_item":"- [ ] Add a warning-value derivation to the Figures section (or state it is unchanged) so the ACs referencing 'the warning values derived above' have a concrete referent.","cohort":["COH","E1","E2","E6","F1","T2","T4","T5a","T5b","T5e"],"criteria":["E2","E1","COH"],"decision":"advisory","decision_margin":-0.1831,"drop_reason":null,"evidence":["Figures 